  <item>
    <title>075.地下喜剧联欢会，唱歌也是一种语言工作！掌声欢迎二人站的朋友们~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c3e922b6c9256aeeaeead9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c3e922b6c9256aeeaeead9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Feb 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上一期是特别节目，这一期又是特别节目，下一期还是特别节目！过年了，全是特别节目！</span></p><p><span>这期我们找了很多行业内的朋友一起参与，每个人都来回答我们给的问题，可以说是完全聚焦于我俩，结果也很出乎意料，很多事情都没想到原来大家是这样想的！</span></p><p><span>下一期是对听众朋友们的有奖征集，征集的方式方法方向方案方方面面的细节大家听我口头介绍，也可以听上一期节目的介绍，上一期介绍的更详细一些，投稿邮箱是：staryinian@qq.com，欢迎来稿！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 介绍本期节目内容，第一次尝试这么大规模的工程，有些细节做得不够好，大家见谅。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">00:06:15</a> 开场歌，伍佰的《与你到永久》。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">00:10:32</a> 团酱郝方舟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">00:15:26</a> 大老王</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">00:22:06</a> 赖铭佳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">00:36:45</a> 小利姐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">00:42:34</a> 小泽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3474">00:57:54</a> 趴体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3666">01:01:06</a> 吴鼎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3858">01:04:18</a> leo+王梓晗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4312">01:11:52</a> 一林</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5140">01:25:40</a> 普拉斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5441">01:30:41</a> 叨叨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5783">01:36:23</a> 漆漆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6174">01:42:54</a> 小麦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6442">01:47:22</a> 小僵尸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6752">01:52:32</a> 母智稀饭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6998">01:56:38</a> 史妍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7402">02:03:22</a> 王继业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9178">02:32:58</a> 虎牙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9547">02:39:07</a> 卢超</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9831">02:43:51</a> 阿泽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10334">02:52:14</a> 孙富贵儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10424">02:53:44</a> 博文</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10751">02:59:11</a> 结语&amp;结尾歌，道雀Bzz的《沙悟净》。</span></p><p><span>喜欢我们的朋友，可以微信添加二人站小助手（vx：erzkefu01) 一起加入听众群聊天吧！</span></p><p><span>使用音乐：《彩 虹 都 市》by ATTBEAT/ATTStudio星</span></p>]]></description>
